WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:07.216
When several source columns become one value column
PostgreSQL needs a common data type If

00:00:07.242 --> 00:00:13.719
one metric is integer and another is numeric
explicit casts may be helpful The

00:00:13.746 --> 00:00:19.308
patient metric example casts selected values to
numeric Do

00:00:19.335 --> 00:00:24.846
not let type coercion become an accidental part of
the reshape Choose

00:00:24.873 --> 00:00:26.807
the long value type deliberately
